244 - My Song Shall Be of Jesus
 / 
Key: Eb
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 244
Topic: Jesus Christ - 

Verse 1:
[Eb]My song [Fm]shall [Eb/G]be [Cm]of Jesus;
[Bb7/F]His mercy [Ab]crowns my [Eb]days,
[Fm]He fills [Cm]my [Bb/D]cup [Eb]with [Bb7/Ab]blessings,
[Cm]And tunes my [Fm]heart to [Bb/D]praise.
[Gm]My [Cm]song shall be [Fm]of Jesus,
[Eb]The precious [Bb7/F]Lamb of [Ab]God,
[Eb]Who [Fm]gave Himself [Gm]my [Ab]ransom,
[Eb]And bought me [Bb]with His blood.

Verse 2:
[Eb]My song [Fm]shall [Eb/G]be [Cm]of Jesus
[Bb7/F]When, sitting [Ab]at His [Eb]feet,
[Fm]I call [Cm]to [Bb/D]mind [Eb]His [Bb7/Ab]goodness
[Cm]In meditation [Bb/D]sweet:
[Gm]My [Cm]song shall be [Fm]of Jesus,
[Eb]Whatever [Bb7/F]ill betide;
[Eb]I'll [Fm]sing the [Bb]grace [Gm]that [Ab]saves [Fm]me,
[Eb]And keeps me [Bb]at His side.

Verse 3:
[Eb]My song [Fm]shall [Eb/G]be [Cm]of Jesus
[Bb7/F]While [Eb]pressing [Ab]on my [Eb]way
[Fm]To reach [Cm]the [Bb/D]blissful [Bb7/Ab]kingdom
[Cm]Of pure and [Fm]perfect [Bb/D]day:
[Gm]And [Cm]when my soul [Fm]shall enter
[Eb]That realm of [Bb7/F]splendor [Ab]fair,
[Eb]A [Fm]song of [Bb]praise [Gm]to [Ab]Jesus
[Eb]I'll sing forever [Bb]there.
